t on her left hand i'd like to have a ring on her ring finger. I'd like for the background to be outside like the photos i will reference. I will also send some examples of the general pose im looking for. I trust you will deliver another amazing piece of art. Thank you very much again!\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/111609639\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/111000543\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/110938456", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@SEBU_illust/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1368192, "client_id": 420175, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0fe3c757/uploads/origins/6d509174-b2ef-4994-9c5e-0152f2c365e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0bb203ac840ff4fad2c67bce53aaf4f5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0fe3c757/uploads/origins/6d509174-b2ef-4994-9c5e-0152f2c365e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0bb203ac840ff4fad2c67bce53aaf4f5, https://si.imgix.net/0fe3c757/uploads/origins/6d509174-b2ef-4994-9c5e-0152f2c365e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90207b35a444c0021e694acfbffa40da 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0fe3c757/uploads/origins/6d509174-b2ef-4994-9c5e-0152f2c365e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=089ae93c17e3894386356a674b5caa86 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0fe3c757/uploads/origins/6d509174-b2ef-4994-9c5e-0152f2c365e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1376a17ace43bce4812918b665a0d17d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0fe3c757/uploads/origins/6d509174-b2ef-4994-9c5e-0152f2c365e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=