 Drive. \n\nI would also like for the white shirt to be partially transparent in order to show the sports bra underneath. Just the shirt, not the cropped hoodie.\n\nShe is wearing the full outfit in the reference images.\n\nI will leave the pose and composition up to you, but overall it should give a flirting or teasing feeling. There are some references on Google Drive too.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ekd8Hlzz0vEWul3xLIGcvirx6ui2jmms?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 864274, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "みー太郎", "screen_name": "mitarou_sk", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1724400448243994624/Ud3eRbTm.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1334806193752010753/1703433859/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 48}, {"id": 1607903, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "すず森", "screen_name": "su2525_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1625342421373689856/Y-oKuYYy.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1376907585974984708/1680129939/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 4, "complete_expiration_days": 70, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 177}, {"id": 1802819, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "八幡たぬき", "screen_name": "hachiman_tanuki", "avatar_url": "https://p